### DBus Frontend Receives Cursor Rectangle

Source: https://github.com/fcitx/fcitx5/blob/master/src/frontend/dbusfrontend/dbusfrontend.cpp

The DBus frontend exposes SetCursorRect and SetCursorRectV2 methods. setCursorRectDBus converts x,y,w,h to a Rect and calls setCursorRect on the InputContext, which stores it and emits CursorRectChangedEvent.

```cpp
void setCursorRectDBus(int x, int y, int w, int h) {
    CHECK_SENDER_OR_RETURN;
    setCursorRect(Rect{x, y, x + w, y + h});
}

void setCursorRectV2DBus(int x, int y, int w, int h, double scale) {
    CHECK_SENDER_OR_RETURN;
    setCursorRect(Rect{x, y, x + w, y + h}, scale);
}

